# Crystal Imperium play test: the Infinite Repel key item really keeps wild Pokemon away, and
# turning it off brings them back. Route 29 wild Pokemon are far below a Lv 50 lead. Since 0.15.2
# (D57) it keeps every wild Pokemon away, not only weaker ones: a level-2 lead, no stronger than
# Route 29's (2 to 4), meets none either. It stays on through a save, a hard reset and CONTINUE.
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
!give_mon(157, 50)
# Route 29, arriving at the Route 46 gate door (34,10); tall grass starts at x=25 on row 14.
# The repel goes on before the first grass step, which could otherwise start a battle.
!warp(0, 11, 0)
!walkto(34, 14, "yx")
# Key Items: 0 RARECANDY BOX, 1 INFIN. REPEL, 2 BOX LINK
!use_key_item(1)
shot 02_repel_on.png
!expect_flag("FLAG_INFINITE_REPEL_ON", 1, "infinite_repel_switched_on")
!walkto(24, 14)
shot 01_in_grass.png
# 10 laps = 80 grass steps with the repel on
!pace(21, 25, 14, 10)
shot 03_walked_with_repel.png
expectne32 {gMain+4} {BattleMainCB2+1} no_battle_with_infinite_repel_on
!use_key_item(1)
shot 04_repel_off.png
!expect_flag("FLAG_INFINITE_REPEL_ON", 0, "infinite_repel_switched_off")
# Without the repel a wild battle starts within a few laps and stops the walk (soft), so this
# part checks the battle state rather than the walk result
!pace(21, 25, 14, 10, soft=True)
shot 05_walked_without_repel.png
expect32 {gMain+4} {BattleMainCB2+1} wild_battle_once_repel_off

# A level-2 lead with the repel on: still no wild Pokemon in 80 grass steps (D57)
reset
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
!give_mon(157, 2)
!warp(0, 11, 0)
!walkto(34, 14, "yx")
!use_key_item(1)
!expect_flag("FLAG_INFINITE_REPEL_ON", 1, "repel_on_with_a_weak_lead")
!walkto(24, 14, soft=True)
!pace(21, 25, 14, 10, soft=True)
shot 06_weak_lead_with_repel.png
expectne32 {gMain+4} {BattleMainCB2+1} no_battle_even_for_a_weak_lead

# Saved with the repel on, then a hard reset and CONTINUE: it is still on, and still no battle
!start_menu("SAVE")
press A
wait 400
mash A 300
reset
wait 1300
press START
wait 320
press A
wait 100
press A
wait 900
shot 07_continued.png
!expect_flag("FLAG_INFINITE_REPEL_ON", 1, "repel_still_on_after_restart")
!pace(21, 25, 14, 10, soft=True)
shot 08_walked_after_restart.png
expectne32 {gMain+4} {BattleMainCB2+1} no_battle_after_restart
